// Flashlight passes: the materials' flashlight snapshots (SHADER_USING_FLASHLIGHT),
// drawn in flashlight mode with a flashlight at ( 0 0 1 ) looking down -z over
// the default quad (clip space, identity transforms, normal +z). worldtotexture
// projects the quad onto the whole cookie (a 90 degree frustum, near 0.1, far
// 10): u = 0.5 + 0.5 x / d, v = 0.5 - 0.5 y / d, w = d = 1 - z. Shadows are off
// (no shadow depth textures), so FLASHLIGHTSHADOWS is 0.
//   LightmappedGeneric: DrawFlashlight_dx90 (lightmappedgeneric_flashlight_vs20,
//   flashlight_ps20b), with and without a bump map.
//   VertexLitGeneric: the FLASHLIGHT combo of vertexlit_and_unlit_generic, of
//   its bump pair, and of skin ($phong).
